        <body>
            <div xml:id="d742">

                <pb facs="0919" n="817" sameAs="frus:frus1908/pg817"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Russell to
                        the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Caracas</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1908-01-04"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">January 4, 1908</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 269.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to your cable of December 19,
                    received in Caracas December 28, and which is acknowledged in a separate
                    dispatch, I have the honor to inform you that I addressed a note to the minister
                    for foreign affairs in accordance with your instructions, a copy of which note
                    is inclosed.</p>
                <p>On January 3 the minister for foreign affairs answered my note, copy and
                    translation of which I inclose.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">William H.
                    Russell.</hi></signed></closer>



